sieve-filter-v1
; A test of the token form's grammar: four word lists, which may follow which, how a sentence may
; start and end, and a word in two sets ("run" is a noun and a verb). Not shipped: CI checks the
; engine against the oracle with it.
id        toy-grammar-cut
version   1
author    Edward James Gordon (written with Claude)
origin    ai-directed
lines     text
symbols   lower27
describe  A toy grammar: determiner, adjectives, noun, verb, and on (cut edges).

tokens    separator " "
edges     cut
set       det   list:det.txt
set       adj   list:adj.txt
set       noun  list:noun.txt
set       verb  list:verb.txt
follow    det   adj
follow    det   noun
follow    adj   adj
follow    adj   noun
follow    noun  verb
follow    verb  det
follow    verb  noun
first     det noun
last      noun verb
end
